ALGORITHM: Maximum Subarray

1. Start.

2. Initialize:
       curr_sum = nums[0]
       max_sum = nums[0]

3. Traverse the array from index 1 to the end.

4. For each element nums[i]:

       curr_sum = max(nums[i],
                      curr_sum + nums[i])

5. Update the maximum sum:

       max_sum = max(max_sum, curr_sum)

6. Continue until all elements are processed.

7. Return max_sum.

TIME COMPLEXITY:
O(n)

SPACE COMPLEXITY:
O(1)
